{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYFoE2yTHyAQDwDACDjc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No flag exists — `load_range` hard-rejects any missing minute, so `generate()` can't build predictions for any asset with a feed gap (every com-equ asset, plus HYPE). Since the contract explicitly says contexts *may* contain NaN, this is a limitation of the helper, not the metric. Patching only the data-loading line, leaving the `backtest()` scoring call untouched:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":155776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1420,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"f5098460-8719-4fa9-bdbc-1216611dc989","timestamp":"2026-09-29T19:08:05.698Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYFoE2yTHyAQDwDACDjc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0117Gfrff7oFaetKzDmQJ2Jf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"uv run python - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"agent/predict.py\"); s = p.read_text()\nold = '''    store = MinutePriceStore(asset, root=store_root(asset))\n    df = store.load_range(start - timedelta(minutes=CONTEXT_MINUTES), end).set_index(\"timestamp\")\n    prices = df[OHLCV_COLUMNS]'''\nnew = '''    df = load_context_frame(asset, start - timedelta(minutes=CONTEXT_MINUTES), end)\n    prices = df[OHLCV_COLUMNS]'''\nassert old in s\ns = s.replace(old, new)\n\nhelper = '''\ndef load_context_frame(asset: str, start: datetime, end: datetime) -> pd.DataFrame:\n    \"\"\"Minute OHLCV for a window, tolerating gaps.\n\n    `MinutePriceStore.load_range` raises on a single NaN close. That is right for scoring, and\n    wrong for building the context: the model contract states that `context_prices` MAY CONTAIN\n    NaN (thin markets, feed outages) and that the model must drop rather than interpolate. With\n    the strict loader, `generate()` cannot produce a prediction for ANY com-equ asset, or HYPE,\n    over a multi-day window -- it aborts with \"Local store has N missing minute prices\".\n\n    So the partitions are read directly (the lenient pattern) and reindexed onto a gapless minute\n    grid, which is what makes `[-CONTEXT_MINUTES:]` mean seven *calendar* days rather than the\n    last 10080 rows that happen to exist. NOTHING about scoring changes: `backtest()` below is\n    untouched and still assembles realized paths itself.\n    \"\"\"\n    root = store_root(asset)\n    frames, cursor = [], start.date()\n    while cursor <= end.date():\n        path = root / f\"date={cursor.isoformat()}.parquet\"\n        if path.exists():\n            frames.append(pd.read_parquet(path))\n        cursor += timedelta(days=1)\n    if not frames:\n        raise SystemExit(f\"no partitions for {asset} under {root}\")\n    frame = pd.concat(frames, ignore_index=True)\n    frame[\"timestamp\"] = pd.to_datetime(frame[\"timestamp\"], utc=True)\n    frame = frame.sort_values(\"timestamp\").drop_duplicates(\"timestamp\").set_index(\"timestamp\")\n    frame = frame[list(OHLCV_COLUMNS)].astype(float)\n    grid = pd.date_range(frame.index[0], frame.index[-1], freq=\"1min\", tz=\"UTC\")\n    return frame.reindex(grid).loc[pd.Timestamp(start) : pd.Timestamp(end)]\n\n\ndef generate('''\ns = s.replace(\"\\ndef generate(\", helper, 1)\np.write_text(s)\nprint(\"patched\")\nPY\ntimeout 900 uv run agent/predict.py --asset HYPE --days 7 --eval-end 2026-09-13 --num-simulations 1000 2>&1 | tail -4","description":"Patch predict.py context loading and retest","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":155776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1420,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"b772b1af-d442-427c-b571-52f7946a4d57","timestamp":"2026-09-29T19:08:16.479Z"}
