{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYPqY1TEThjpPZ8XGiMJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016AF2y7T3wGMZrgWTLndXfn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A agent && git -c user.name=\"campaign-4 agent\" commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nSeasonal exponent is step-dependent: 1.35 at 5-min, 0.85 at 1-min\n\nThe global gamma=0.85 was confounded with the width level: re-optimising `scale`\nat each gamma reverses the sign on the 24h configurations. With scale free, gamma\nrises to ~1.35 on every 24h asset and on all three windows (dev -0.20%, holdout\n-0.48%, test -0.55%), while crypto-1h prefers 0.85 on all three. Refitting the\nper-asset com-equ multipliers at the new gamma adds a little more (-0.29/-0.50/-0.58),\nand they are again stable under refitting four months apart.\n\n2026-07-24..08-25 is a third window held out from every earlier experiment; gamma\nwas picked on dev+test, so that window is the honest read.\n\nAlso: agent/eda_range.py, a negative result -- Parkinson/Garman-Klass range\nestimators forecast future vol *worse* than close-to-close here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1\nrm -f miner_outputs/campaign/predictions/*.json\nnohup bash agent/official_eval.sh    agent /workspace/miner_outputs/off_champ2.json /workspace/miner_outputs/champ2.log >/dev/null 2>&1 &\necho launched-24h","description":"Commit model change and launch 24h re-evaluation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":698,"cache_read_input_tokens":128669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":698,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"43f394c8-