{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYWdR5ia5yjAMhh4ayAC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Champion unchanged and committed. Budget is at 37 %, so there's room for another angle: the crypto-1h leg improved least (−3.9 % vs −4.1/−12.1), and its width level has never been fitted at its own horizon — `scale = 0.90` was chosen on 24h prompts."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":55508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":594,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"5c6ac48f-8edc-4294-abe8-c1a9bf79d9c5","timestamp":"2026-09-29T22:22:43.970Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYWdR5ia5yjAMhh4ayAC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MUnLb5jwsvUjDEFZdMXDKP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /workspace/agent/exp_scale_1h.py <<'EOF'\n\"\"\"Is the global width level right at the 1-minute step?\n\n`scale = 0.90` was fitted on 24-hour prompts at the 5-minute step and is reused verbatim for\nCRYPTO_1H. Nothing guarantees that transfers: a 1-minute return is a different random variable\n(bid-ask bounce, zero-return minutes, discreteness), so the EWMA variance of the context can be\nbiased relative to the scored quantity in a way the 5-minute step never showed.\n\nPer §2 a level error costs 0.25*(log ratio)^2, so a 20 % miss is worth ~1 %. Cheap to check.\n\nRun: uv run python agent/exp_scale_1h.py\n\"\"\"\n\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/workspace/agent\")\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom evaluate import EvalConfig, run\nfrom modeling import CHAMPION_SPEC\nfrom sweep import ASSETS\n\n_, base = CHAMPION_SPEC\nkw = dict(base, profile=\"tow_pre0701.npz\")\nWIN = {\"dev\": [(\"2026-07-05\", \"2026-07-23\")], \"test\": [(\"2026-08-26\", \"2026-09-13\")]}\nSC = (0.75, 0.80, 0.85, 0.90, 0.95, 1.00, 1.10)\n\nout = {}\nper_asset = {}\nfor wname, win in WIN.items():\n    cfg = EvalConfig(windows=win, assets=ASSETS[\"crypto\"], time_length=3600, time_increment=60,\n                     cadence_minutes=180, num_simulations=500)\n    for s in SC:\n        d = run((\"models\", \"sv_model\", dict(kw, scale=s)), cfg).groupby(\"asset\")[\"crps\"].mean()\n        out.setdefault(s, {})[wname] = d.mean()\n        per_asset.setdefault(wname, {})[s] = d\ntab = pd.DataFrame(out).T\nfor w in WIN:\n    tab[w + \"_%\"] = 100 * (tab[w] / tab.loc[0.90, w] - 1)\nprint(\"### crypto 1h, global scale\"); print(tab.round(3).to_string())\nfor w in WIN:\n    print(f\"\\n### crypto 1h per-asset, {w}\")\n    print(pd.DataFrame(per_asset[w]).T.round(2).to_string())\nEOF\ncd /workspace && uv run python agent/exp_scale_1h.py 2>&1 | tail -30","description":"Sweep global width scale at the 1-minute step","timeout":1800000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":55508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":594,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"6ebfc5d8-90b2-4e75-b946-2640e0c19a51","timestamp":"2026-09-29T22:22:52.800Z"}
