lution. The parameter was still fitted correctly","+and still transfers; only the story attached to it was wrong, and the report is corrected.","+","+**Also fixed**: `fit_profile` returned an all-NaN array when no bucket cleared the","+20-observation threshold (SPCX at 10-minute buckets), which would have silently produced NaN","+prices rather than failing. It now returns a flat profile."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/workspace/agent/journal.md"]}}}
