{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrTM7mZ4JrJWmqGevYTdPU","type":"tool_result","content":"## 3. The model\n\n```\nr_k = scale(asset) · v_k · s(t_k) · z ,        price_k = last · exp(cumsum(r))\n```\n\n* **`s(t_k)` — time-of-week seasonality.** A 336-bucket (half-hourly) profile per asset and step\n  size, fitted offline and committed as an artifact. The venues never close but the underlying\n  markets do: mean |5-minute return| swings ≈1.8× across the week for crypto and up to ≈6× for\n  the tokenised equities. The profile is raised to the power **1.35 at the 5-minute step and 0.85\n  at the 1-minute step** — the two horizons want opposite corrections, and three disjoint windows\n  agree on both signs (§5).\n* **`v_k` — conditional volatility of the *deseasonalised* returns.** A geometric blend of EWMA\n  variances at half-lives of 1 h / 6 h / 48 h, reverting log-linearly toward the 7-day level with\n  a half-life of 96 steps.\n* **`z` — standardised Student-t(4).** Gaussian innovations cost about 1 %.\n* **`scale(asset)`** — 0.90 for every crypto asset; one fitted multiplier each for the eight\n  com-equ assets (0.61–0.91 of the crypto width).\n\nOne configuration serves all three scoring configurations. It runs offline in ~40 ms per prompt\nat 1000 paths, against a practical ceiling of about 5 s.\n\nEverything in the model is there because it survived a check on a validation window it was not\ntuned on. Most of what I tried did not.\n\n## 4. What worked","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"9675cb67-f4ea-45cf-ae90-550f9015ac71","timestamp":"2026-09-29T23:35:17.603Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 3. The model\n\n```\nr_k = scale(asset) · v_k · s(t_k) · z ,        price_k = last · exp(cumsum(r))\n```\n\n* **`s(t_k)` — time-of-week seasonality.** A 336-bucket (half-hourly) profile per asset and step\n  size, fitted offline and committed as an artifact. The venues never close but the underlying\n  markets do: mean |5-minute return| swings ≈1.8× across the week for crypto and up to ≈6× for\n  the tokenised equities. The profile is raised to the power **1.35 at the 5-minute step and 0.85\n  at the 1-minute step** — the two horizons want opposite corrections, and three disjoint windows\n  agree on both signs (§5).\n* **`v_k` — conditional volatility of the *deseasonalised* returns.** A geometric blend of EWMA\n  variances at half-lives of 1 h / 6 h / 48 h, reverting log-linearly toward the 7-day level with\n  a half-life of 96 steps.\n* **`z` — standardised Student-t(4).** Gaussian innovations cost about 1 %.\n* **`scale(asset)`** — 0.90 for every crypto asset; one fitted multiplier each for the eight\n  com-equ assets (0.61–0.91 of the crypto width).\n\nOne configuration serves all three scoring configurations. It runs offline in ~40 ms per prompt\nat 1000 paths, against a practical ceiling of about 5 s.\n\nEverything in the model is there because it survived a check on a validation window it was not\ntuned on. Most of what I tried did not.\n\n## 4. What worked","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYcBxrtbciYivp1Y9wjP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AgicAXVobFAg6GMvpzdaQG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"uv run python - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"agent/report.md\"); s = p.read_text()\nold = \"\"\"```\nr_k = scale(asset) · v_k · s(t_k) · z ,        price_k = last · exp(cumsum(r))\n```\n\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"```\nr_k = scale(asset, step) · v_k · s(t_k) · m_k · z ,    price_k = last · exp(cumsum(r))\n```\n\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old) == 1\ns = s.replace(old, new, 1)\n\nold2 = \"\"\"* **`z` — standardised Student-t(4).** Gaussian innovations cost about 1 %.\n* **`scale(asset)`** — 0.90 for every crypto asset; one fitted multiplier each for the eight\n  com-equ assets (0.61–0.91 of the crypto width).\n\nOne configuration serves all three scoring configurations. It runs offline in ~40 ms per prompt\nat 1000 paths, against a practical ceiling of about 5 s.\"\"\"\nnew2 = \"\"\"* **`z` — standardised Student-t(4).** Gaussian innovations cost about 1 %.\n* **`m_k` — a persistent AR(1) factor in log-volatility**, drawn per path and renormalised so\n  that *every step's variance is exactly unchanged*. It does not touch the per-step marginal; it\n  fattens the **aggregated** intervals, which a deterministic σ path leaves too close to Gaussian\n  by the CLT and which are 39 % of a 24-hour score. On for the com-equ assets (stationary sd\n  0.30), off for crypto, where it flips sign between windows.\n* **`scale(asset, step)`** — 0.90 at the 5-minute step and 0.95 at the 1-minute step for crypto;\n  one fitted multiplier each for the eight com-equ assets (0.64–0.96 of the crypto width).\n\nOne configuration serves all three scoring configurations. It runs offline in ~50 ms per prompt\nat 1000 paths, against a practical ceiling of about 5 s.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old2) == 1\ns = s.replace(old2, new2, 1)\np.write_text(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nPY\ntail -3 /tmp/off2.log 2>/dev/null; grep -c . /workspace/miner_outputs/off_champ2.json 2>/dev/null","description":"Update report model description"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_read_input_tokens":136900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":907,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"6ad5ba1f-3ba7-4f16-9b31-0b231153ee56","timestamp":"2026-09-29T23:35:26.338Z"}
