{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYcWYEaa4W8Qtw5waShn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0111ETTfUX5euaEdyyBAoVJL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add -A agent && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nChampion: fatten the aggregated intervals; step-keyed width level\n\nTwo changes, both validated on three disjoint windows.\n\n1. vov_ar: a persistent AR(1) factor in log-volatility, renormalised so every\n   step's variance is exactly unchanged. Pure shape change aimed at the ~39%\n   of a 24h score charged on intervals longer than one step, which a\n   deterministic sigma path leaves too close to Gaussian. -0.096/-0.096/-0.102%\n   on com-equ; crypto flips sign between windows and is left off. The earlier\n   constant-per-path vol_of_vol failed because it moved the per-step marginal\n   too; the renormalisation is what makes the idea work.\n\n   Comes with the level correction it implies: a fatter mixture at fixed\n   variance is narrower in the bulk, so the com-equ optimum moves 0.90 -> 0.95\n   on all three windows. Applied as a uniform factor on SCALE_MAP.\n\n2. scale is now keyed on step size, like seas_gamma: 0.95 at the 1-minute step\n   beats 0.90 by -0.085/-0.215/-0.049%, while at the 5-minute step crypto flips\n   sign between windows so 0.90 stays.\n\ncrypto-24h is bit-identical, confirming neither change reaches it. Served\ninterface re-verified offline from /tmp: shapes, NaN context, seeding, 53 ms\nper 1000-path prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the champion change"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1610,"cache_read_input_tokens":141173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1610,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"6aa2d3f8-ef94-47da-9eba-e7f423b80c26","timestamp":"2026-09-29T23:39:45.072Z"}
