ypto flips sign between windows and 0.90 is the compromise.\n75:# Exponent on the time-of-week profile, keyed by step size in minutes. The two horizons want\n76:# opposite corrections and three disjoint windows agree on both signs: at the 5-minute step the\n78:# 0.25-4.0 clip all shrink it toward flat, and 1.35 un-shrinks it), while at the 1-minute step\n79:# it must be *damped*. The damping is a property of the return, not of the profile: a 1-minute\n80:# print carries bid-ask bounce and zero-return minutes, width that does not follow time-of-week,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
