he level as a side effect; an\n680:window. The per-step marginal is already fat (Student-t(4)); the aggregates are not.\n718:Re-checked `nu` with the factor on, since both control kurtosis at different aggregation scales:\n719:3.5, 5 and 6 are all within ±0.13 % of 4 with no consistent sign. `nu = 4` stands.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
