{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfYpZztShd5CsvYAkxhMc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PPk8ELUX9K9CdoTVjkwwof","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\n**Official re-run.** Only the eight com-equ legs changed (verified bit-identical on crypto), and\n`predict.py` at 1000 paths moves COM_EQU_24H from 1822.5 to **1820.7** against the starting point's\n2076.5 — −12.23 % to **−12.32 %**. Crypto stands at −4.14 % and −4.00 %.\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'MSG'\nLook back further than the seven-day context: a committed long-run volatility level\n\nsv_model reverts toward v_long, a slow EWMA of the context -- but the context IS seven\ndays, so the target is estimated from one week and a hot week leaves a target that is\nitself an overshoot. agent/vlong.py fits one long-run level per (asset, step) over the\nwhole snapshot, deseasonalised by the same bent profile the model uses so the blend is\nnot a units error, and commits it as an artifact; sv_model blends it into the target in\nlogs at weight 0.2 for the eight com-equ assets.\n\nWorth -0.168 / -0.026 / -0.039 % on three disjoint windows at the width that ships, with\nno level correction of its own; negative in 21 of 24 asset-window cells, at every blend\nin 0.1-0.3, and under two artifact vintages. Staleness does not explain why the first\nwindow is four times better -- refitting the level immediately before each window buys\n0.007 pp. Crypto flips sign between windows at 24h and is flat at 1h, so it stays at 0.\n\nThis is the first thing shipped whose out-of-sample size is below the 0.1 % bar; it goes\nin on the consistency of the sign, not the size, and the journal says so. Official\nCOM_EQU_24H 1822.5 -> 1820.7 (-12.23 % -> -12.32 %); crypto legs bit-identical.\n\nThe lesson corrects Iteration 16: non-redundant information does not have to be\nforward-looking, it has to be outside what a fast EWMA of the context can see -- which\nincludes anything further in the past than the seven-day window reaches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nMSG\n)\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Commit iteration 25"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":215,"cache_read_input_tokens":95962,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":215,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"ceae99d3-edfc-42fd-98a4-fe7ad534c930","timestamp":"2026-09-30T02:17:48.477Z"}
