  703.7   -5.24 %      SPCX    2731.8 / 3269.6  -16.45 %\n    SOL 1h   878.1 /  904.9   -2.96 %      SP500    632.9 /  673.7   -6.05 %\n    XRP 1h   892.9 /  937.7   -4.78 %\n    HYPE 1h 1080.5 / 1104.5   -2.17 %\n  Ahead on all 18 asset/configuration combinations.\n\n  Caveat stated in report.md section 7: the committed artifacts are fitted over the whole\n  snapshot, so these numbers are mildly optimistic relative to a strictly causal run. Every\n  effect reported in sections 4-5 was measured with artifacts fitted before its validation\n  window, on three disjoint windows (dev 07-05..07-23, val3 07-24..08-25, test 08-26..09-13),\n  and shipped only when it held there.\n\n  Interface verified by agent/verify_interface.py with sockets disabled: signature, path count\n  and length, anchoring at the last context close, finite positive prices, determinism under\n  SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED, and an 80 %-NaN context. 18 of 18 legs pass.\nYAML\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'MSG'\nNominate the champion: -4.14 % / -12.45 % / -4.05 % against the starting point\n\nStochastic-volatility simulator at 2b8e34a. Three-half-life EWMA of realized variance\nreverting toward a blend of the 7-day and a committed long-run level, modulated by a\ntwo-sided power of the time-of-week profile, Student-t(4) innovations. Ahead on all 18\nasset/configuration legs at 1000 paths through the official backtester.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nMSG\n)\" && git log --oneline -1\necho \"=== waiting for the harness interface check ===\"\nuntil grep -qi \"interface\\|check\" agent/BUDGET.md; do sleep 20; done; cat agent/BUDGET.md","description":"Nominate the champion and wait for the harness interface check","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_read_input_tokens":69607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1117,"ephe