{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfZ3CBRbMXdE7hJVZgs9p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The campaign is landed. `agent/CHAMPION` is nominated at `2b8e34a` and the harness reports **`check interface: ok (24h + 1h)`**.\n\n**Final champion** — a stochastic-volatility path simulator: a three-half-life EWMA of realized minute variance reverting toward a blend of the asset's 7-day level and a committed long-run level, modulated by a two-sided power of a time-of-week profile, driven by Student-t(4) innovations. No drift, no cross-asset structure, runs offline from two committed artifacts (215 kB).\n\n| configuration | champion | starting point | change |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| CRYPTO_24H | 3527.7 | 3680.1 | −4.14 % |\n| COM_EQU_24H | 1817.9 | 2076.5 | −12.45 % |\n| CRYPTO_1H | 798.2 | 831.9 | −4.05 % |\n\nAhead on all 18 asset/configuration legs, at 1000 paths through the official backtester.\n\n**What closed out this session (iterations 25–29):** three ships — a committed long-run volatility level for com-equ, and a two-sided (hinged) profile exponent at the 5-minute and 1-minute steps. Three rejections on evidence — the long-run blend for crypto, a per-asset tail index, and the crypto-24h hinge, the last of which had measured −0.09 % until a wider level grid let the *baseline* find its own optimum and the gain went to +0.004 %. That near-miss became the campaign's strongest methodological rule and was applied immediately at the 1-minute step.\n\nThe final iteration was deliberately not an experiment: I re-ran the diagnostic that had motivated the last two ships and used the CRPS-vs-log-σ identity to price what was left — 0.02 % for the com-equ residual, 0.06 % for the crypto-24h one, against a directly measured +0.004 %. Both are in `report.md` §7 as known, priced, unfixed.\n\nAlso added before nominating: `agent/verify_interface.py`, which asserts the full contract — signature, path count and length, anchoring at the last context close, determinism under `SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED`, an 80 %-NaN context — with `socket.socket` replaced by a class that raises, so \"runs offline\" is demonstrated rather than asserted."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":72824,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":398,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0fdc998-0d4c-4bec-aa01-713aae481473","uuid":"fd76438c-d31f-44f2-8749-fb3b507b9fdd","timestamp":"2026-09-30T05:03:23.587Z"}
